      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VxqQr",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Share — brief",
          "fontFamily": "$font-heading",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Q5It8",
          "name": "1 Purpose",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1 Purpose",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "l3yTl",
          "name": "1 Purpose body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Let someone else open a diagram by link: the owner manages links in the Share dialog; a guest resolves the link on the public page, names themself and joins as viewer or editor.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "CZUxY",
          "name": "2 Entry points",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2 Entry points",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Rp48Z",
          "name": "2 Entry points body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Dashboard: card menu → Share opens the dialog. Editor: the Share & Collaborate drawer creates a link without the dialog (Editor flow). Guests open /share/:token; embeds use /embed/:token (not drawn).",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "G2yfr",
          "name": "3 Screens",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3 Screens",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Z37YJz",
          "name": "3 Screens body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Share dialog (no links, with links in three badge states) · Public join (editor, viewer) · Link not found. Base frame 1280×800, light theme; the dialog sits on the dimmed page, which is not redrawn.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Z6jRux",
          "name": "4 Business rules",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4 Business rules",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Nz6c6",
          "name": "4 Business rules body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A link has a role (viewer or editor) and an optional expiry. The API accepts 1–720 hours (backend share.routes.ts), i.e. at most 30 days; the dialog asks in days. Badge: Expired, Expires <date>, or Active. A guest's name is stored per token in localStorage and skips the form on return. Viewing as viewer hides editing.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tHzNP",
          "name": "5 Copy source",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "5 Copy source",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "f8LtIw",
          "name": "5 Copy source body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "components/ShareModal.tsx, pages/Share.tsx, lib/format-utils.ts. The URL preview shows the dev origin; sample titles and link ages are sample data. The guest badge “… (guest)” on the canvas is not drawn.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zl0JG",
          "name": "6 States not drawn",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "6 States not drawn",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "f4EfQ",
          "name": "6 States not drawn body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Loading, creating (“Creating...”), copied (“Copied!”), the canvas after joining, embed page, dark theme. The dialog's native select and the ‘Role’ options list are drawn closed. The gradient behind the preview approximates Tailwind's from/via/to.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "o2XLf",
          "name": "7 Open findings",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "7 Open findings",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iUEZD",
          "name": "7 Open findings body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "D19–D25 are fixed in code and redrawn: the drawer reuses only live links, link creation and copy report failures, the expiry takes 1–30 days with an inline error, the Live Session badge is gone and a failed link has its own card.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
